<title>USA: Circus Circus sets $300 mln in two-part debt.</title>
<headline>Circus Circus sets $300 mln in two-part debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Circus Circus Enterprises priced on Thursday, according to dealers.</p>
<p>BORROWER CIRCUS CIRCUS ENTERPRISES</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.00	 MATURITY  11/15/36</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 99.892  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD  7.013	PAY FREQ</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P  BBB-PLUS SPREAD 87 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>*ISSUE IS PUTTABLE ON 11/15/08</p>
<p>*GOLDMAN SACHS &amp; CO LEAD UNDERWRITER ON 40-YEAR ISSUE</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.70	 MATURITY 11/15/96</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 99.777  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD  6.74	 PAY FREQ</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 67 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>*ISSUE IS PUTTABLE ON 11/15/03</p>
<p>*MORGAN STANLEY &amp; CO WAS LEAD UNDERWRITER ON 100-YEAR ISSUE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1675</p>
